cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "urg-forecast-core"
abstract: >-
  Open reference pipeline for Chilean emergency department analytics,
  probabilistic forecasting, and Monte Carlo occupancy simulation: a
  visits-to-hourly-occupancy transform, Chilean calendar features, a uniform
  quantile Forecaster interface (seasonal-naive, statsforecast, LightGBM), an
  evaluation harness, an empirical-LOS Monte Carlo engine, a DEIS MINSAL
  open-data client, and a minimal reference dashboard.
type: software
